PASS/FAIL: FAIL

GENERAL SHAPES: NOT RUN (256 gate failed)

Precision class: TF32 multiply + FP32 accumulation

========================================
ROOT CAUSE
========================================
TF32 has 10-bit mantissa (vs 23-bit FP32). Relative precision ≈ 0.1% per operation.
With 32 K-tiles (K=256, MMA_K=8) accumulating, error compounds beyond the
project's 1% relative tolerance.

Outliers (1.6%) occur where FP32 reference is small, causing large
relative error from TF32 rounding. max_rel = 1.66 exceeds 1% gate.

DO NOT loosen tolerance per instructions.

